    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anna: <i>Exciting Affection</i> is a visual novel about a regular girl who moves to Sun City with her boyfriend, Andrew. It's the start of a new chapter in her life. Anna will be thrown into city life and will have to learn to navigate a world of intrigue, adventure, passion, and lust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/a6e49233312219e40c4c4a42416cf9e6.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will take control of Anna's climb up the corporate ladder, become more involved with local criminal elements, try to become a model, or get more &quot;involved&quot; with the industry elements, all while trying to stay faithful to her boyfriend\u2014or not. Multiple unique and interesting characters will cross paths with Anna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.poster.avif?t=1754398557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.webm?t=1754398557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.mp4?t=1754398557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5000 renders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 100 animated sex scenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 6 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of interesting locations!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge amount of sexy outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lof of fetishes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/49d1542f9a7340d4b8134fe7fce0dcea.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the end, the choices she makes and the paths she takes in life will be entirely up to the player, and the outcomes will differ depending on those choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/585584cb091e5bc4ee99e695edb50857.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was in development from 2018 to 2021 and has since been finished as Chapter 1.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anna: <i>Exciting Affection</i> is a visual novel about a regular girl who moves to Sun City with her boyfriend, Andrew. It's the start of a new chapter in her life. Anna will be thrown into city life and will have to learn to navigate a world of intrigue, adventure, passion, and lust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/a6e49233312219e40c4c4a42416cf9e6.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will take control of Anna's climb up the corporate ladder, become more involved with local criminal elements, try to become a model, or get more &quot;involved&quot; with the industry elements, all while trying to stay faithful to her boyfriend\u2014or not. Multiple unique and interesting characters will cross paths with Anna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.poster.avif?t=1754398557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.webm?t=1754398557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/b76f921102ac80ef3bfed66f917d395c.mp4?t=1754398557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5000 renders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 100 animated sex scenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 6 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of interesting locations!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge amount of sexy outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lof of fetishes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/49d1542f9a7340d4b8134fe7fce0dcea.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the end, the choices she makes and the paths she takes in life will be entirely up to the player, and the outcomes will differ depending on those choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208910/extras/585584cb091e5bc4ee99e695edb50857.avif?t=1754398557\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was in development from 2018 to 2021 and has since been finished as Chapter 1.</p>",
